 "name": "Cinderhold",
 "about": "Muspelheim, realm of fire. Cinderhold is built on terraces down the wall of a vast caldera: black basalt houses with copper-red roofs, lava-falls pouring into glowing channels, bridges of cooled glass, forge-glow in every window and drifting ember motes. Arrival from Bifrost through the red arch; the Sigil Forge on the upper terrace; the glass bridge east to the Lavafalls. SKELETON (stand-in kit).",
